      "content": "Attached is the full technical brief and the current load profiles. \n\nWhile you're looking through it, pay close attention to the transition phase in section 4.2. It outlines the decommissioning schedule for the centralized control layers. We're aiming to have the central processing unit transitioned to a passive monitoring role by Q1 of next year, with the local hardware taking over all active load balancing. Let me know if you see any immediate red flags with that timeline.",
