      "content": "I will run the worst-case scenario simulation focusing specifically on the Q1 handover point, treating the central unit as a tertiary, non-controlling data source. This will allow us to pinpoint the exact magnitude and duration of any frequency deviations under maximum simulated load variability. Once the points of instability are isolated, we can analyze the necessary parameters—such as ramp rates or deadband tolerances—to calibrate your local switches for autonomous operation. Please allow me time to process this high-fidelity stress test.",
